{
  "name": "BonusB3 Google Docs — B Half-Built (find the 3 gaps)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "manual",
      "name": "Run Workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 400],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "input",
      "name": "Set Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [440, 400],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "i1", "name": "doc_id", "value": "", "type": "string" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fetch",
      "name": "Fetch Doc (export as text)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [660, 400],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "=https://docs.google.com/document/d/DOC_ID_HERE/export?format=txt",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": { "responseFormat": "text", "outputPropertyName": "doc_text" }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "extract",
      "name": "Extract Action Items",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [880, 400],
      "parameters": { "promptType": "define", "text": "" }
    },
    {
      "id": "output",
      "name": "Result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1100, 400],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "o1", "name": "action_items", "value": "={{ $json.text }}", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "o2", "name": "source_doc_id", "value": "={{ $('Set Input').item.json.doc_id }}", "type": "string" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ollama",
      "name": "Ollama Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOllama",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [880, 600],
      "parameters": { "model": "llama3.1:8b" }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-gaps",
      "name": "Gaps",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [200, 60],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 1100,
        "height": 300,
        "color": 5,
        "content": "## Half-Built — 3 gaps\n\nFirst, publish a Google Doc (see setup below). Then fill the gaps.\n\n1. **Set Input → `doc_id`** is blank. Paste the ID of your link-shared / published Google Doc — the part between `/d/` and `/edit` in its URL.\n2. **Fetch Doc → URL** contains a placeholder `DOC_ID_HERE`. Replace it with an expression that reads the field you just set, so the URL is built from the input:\n   `=https://docs.google.com/document/d/{{ $('Set Input').item.json.doc_id }}/export?format=txt`\n3. **Extract Action Items → prompt** is blank. The fetched text is at `{{ $json.doc_text }}`. Write a prompt that pulls the action items into a Markdown checklist with owner and due date.\n\n**Already done:** the HTTP node is set to return the response as plain text into a field called `doc_text` (Options → Response → Response Format = Text).\n\n**Setup:** Share your doc → *Anyone with the link → Viewer*. If you get HTML back, sharing isn't on. **No doc?** Use `B3-c-reference-offline.workflow.json`."
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Run Workflow": { "main": [[{ "node": "Set Input", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Set Input": { "main": [[{ "node": "Fetch Doc (export as text)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Fetch Doc (export as text)": { "main": [[{ "node": "Extract Action Items", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Extract Action Items": { "main": [[{ "node": "Result", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Ollama Chat Model": { "ai_languageModel": [[{ "node": "Extract Action Items", "type": "ai_languageModel", "index": 0 }]] }
  },
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1", "timezone": "Asia/Singapore" }
}
